                Get pvValue to bValue
                Set pbMarkupEnabled of zzCal_Object to bValue
            End_Procedure        
        End_Object

        //---------------------------------------------------------------------

        Object o_piMinColumnWidth is a cSigCJPropertyGridSpinFormItem
            Set psLabel    to "Min Column Width"
            Set psHelpText to "Minimum column width in day view. -1 = Auto / 0 = No minimum / +ve = width in pixels."
            Set peItemType to ePGItype_Number
            Set piMinimum  to -1 
            Set piMaximum  to 100
            Set pvInitialValue to (piMinColumnWidth(zzCal_Object))  

            Procedure OnChange
                Integer iValue
            
                Get pvValue to iValue
                Set piMinColumnWidth  of zzCal_Object to iValue
                Send ComPopulate of zzCal_Object 
            End_Procedure        
        End_Object

