        Object oItem_TimeScale is a cSigCJPropertyGridComboFormItem
            Set psLabel to "Time Scale"
            Set psHelpText to "Sets the time Scale interval."
            Set peItemType to ePGItype_Enum
            Set pvInitialValue to (peTimeScale(zzCal_Object))

            Procedure OnAddLookupItems
                Send AddLookupItem (String(eCal_TimeScale_5 ) + " Minutes") eCal_TimeScale_5   "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem (String(eCal_TimeScale_10) + " Minutes") eCal_TimeScale_10  "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem (String(eCal_TimeScale_15) + " Minutes") eCal_TimeScale_15  "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem (String(eCal_TimeScale_30) + " Minutes") eCal_TimeScale_30  "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem (String(eCal_TimeScale_60) + " Minutes") eCal_TimeScale_60  "" ""                      
            End_Procedure

            Procedure OnChange
                String sValue
            
                Get pvValue to sValue
                Set peTimeScale of zzCal_Object to sValue
            End_Procedure        
        End_Object

        //---------------------------------------------------------------------

        Object o_peDayViewCurrentTimeMarkVisible is a cSigCJPropertyGridComboFormItem
            Set psLabel to "Time Mark visible"
            Set psHelpText to "Specifies when the Time Mark is displayed on the time scale."
            Set peItemType to ePGItype_Enum
            Set pvInitialValue to (peDayViewCurrentTimeMarkVisible(zzCal_Object))  

            Procedure OnAddLookupItems
                Send AddLookupItem "None"       eCal_TM_None            "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem "Today Only" eCal_TM_VisibleForToday "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem "Always"     eCal_TM_VisibleAlways   "" ""  
                Send AddLookupItem "Printed"    eCal_TM_Printed         "" ""  
            End_Procedure

            Procedure OnChange
                Integer eValue
            
                Get pvValue to eValue
                Set peDayViewCurrentTimeMarkVisible of zzCal_Object to eValue
            End_Procedure        
        End_Object

